<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger drops iLvl-496 Tier 14 legs and gloves as well as various iLvl-483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. If you can find a group then it's worth killing as a fresh level 90 its gear won't last you very long.<br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90911/furyheart-treads">
<img alt="Furyheart Treads" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Furyheart Treads</span></a>.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reputation for Discipline Priests in Phase 3</span></h2>Improving your reputation with factions unlocks gear you can buy for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. You can get reputation with all of these at once but <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> is limited so you'll want to pick your first buys carefully. For the most part you can disregard low level valor purchases - even if they are quite cheap now.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shadow-pan-assault">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Shado-Pan Assault</span></h3>Shado-Pan Assault is the new faction in phase 3 and it offers some very strong 522-ilvl pieces. You'll get most of your rep via the raid though you can also get it slowly outside.<br/>
<br/>
